---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getLastVerifiedDate } from '../lib/deals';

const lastVerified = getLastVerifiedDate();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & disclosure — BF Deals 2026"
  description="About this Black Friday / Cyber Monday 2026 deals site, how prices are verified, and affiliate / advertising disclosure."
  path="/about/"
>
  <article class="page wrap prose">
    <h1>About &amp; disclosure</h1>

    <p>
      <strong>BF Deals 2026</strong> is a lightweight, static roundup of Black Friday
      and Cyber Monday offers for shoppers interested in AI tools, developer tools,
      SaaS apps, hosting, VPN, and related software. The live site is hosted on
      Cloudflare Pages at
      <a href="https://bf-deals.pages.dev">bf-deals.pages.dev</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>How deals are chosen</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Every listed price and discount string is copied from an official merchant
        page on the <code>verified_at</code> date — we do not invent or recompute prices.
      </li>
      <li>
        Deals whose <code>end_date</code> is in the past are hidden automatically.
      </li>
      <li>
        Vietnam marketplace campaigns can live in the data file with
        <code>hidden: true</code>; v1 focuses on international deals.
      </li>
      <li>Last research pass reflected on this build: {lastVerified || '—'}</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Affiliate &amp; advertising disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Some links are affiliate links; we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
    </p>
    <p>
      Một số link là link affiliate, mình có thể nhận hoa hồng mà bạn không tốn thêm tiền.
    </p>
    <p>
      Affiliate links use <code>rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"</code> and point to
      the real merchant (no cloaking redirects). Deals without a configured affiliate
      program are labeled <em>Hook deal, no affiliate</em> and link to the official
      source URL.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site may participate in affiliate networks and merchant programs such as
      AccessTrade, Impact, CJ, Awin, Amazon Associates, Hostinger, NordVPN, and others
      listed in <code>AFFILIATE_SETUP.md</code>. Commission rates and approval status
      are set by each program — not by this site.
    </p>

    <h2>Prices may change</h2>
    <p>
      Merchants update sale pages frequently during BF/CM week. Always confirm the
      live price, stock, and terms on the merchant page before buying.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact / owner</h2>
    <p>
      Editorial ownership: Duy Khang Hà Lê. Affiliate signup steps for the owner are
      documented in the repository file <code>AFFILIATE_SETUP.md</code> (not a public
      signup form on this site).
    </p>

    <p><a href="/">← Back to deals</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
